  "notes": [
    "Images are original downloaded brand assets; no brand was redrawn or approximated.",
    "DCD is the exact inline SVG extracted from its official homepage; currentColor resolves to black when loaded as an external image.",
    "Cushman and STTGDC owner websites returned HTTP 403. Their real logos were obtained from named industry partners' official public pages.",
    "w.media currently uses a white wordmark and blue waveform icon. The icon is the recommended version for a white interface. The selected design's older plain navy wordmark was not found.",
    "DC Byte's current downloaded official logo is purple/magenta, different from the navy wordmark in the selected reference. Preserve the real asset rather than imitating the reference's brand styling.",
    "All raster assets were successfully decoded, dimensions checked, and visually inspected. DCD SVG is XML-valid and contains the two original logo paths.",
    "2026-10-09: Added the 38 previously unmapped source identities. Existing nine mappings and original assets are unchanged. White original logos use a dark CSS backing; no brand artwork was redrawn.",
    "Three domains (Thai BOI, West Java Bappeda, Philippines BOI) use the public favicon cache for that exact official domain. These are third-party cached site icons, not direct owner downloads. Logo availability does not change source or article verification status."
